OL,3,GNEWSACourt hears Hampstead ponds trans
OL,4,Aaccess challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court challenge to the
OL,7,Ftransgender access policy at Hampstead
OL,8,FHeath's single-sex swimming ponds has
OL,9,Fheard arguments that it compromises
OL,10,Fwomen's "privacy, dignity and sense of
OL,11,Fsafety".
OL,13,FThe charity Sex Matters is disputing
OL,14,FCity of London Corporation rules that
OL,15,Fallow access to the north London ponds
OL,16,Fbased on gender identity rather than
OL,17,Fbiological sex.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1793723174
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACourt hears Hampstead ponds trans
OL,4,Aaccess challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepresenting the corporation, David
OL,7,FStilitz KC said changing the policy
OL,8,F"would prevent [trans people] using the
OL,9,Fpond corresponding to their lived
OL,10,Fgender, which is recognised as an
OL,11,Faspect of their rights".
OL,13,FThe case will determine whether the
OL,14,Fpolicy is lawful following the Supreme
OL,15,FCourt ruling that a woman is defined by
OL,16,Fbiological sex.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
